WEBVTT

01:25.280 --> 01:30.920
‪ADAPTED FROM A SHUQI.COM NOVEL
‪ORIGINAL AUTHOR: SENLIN LU

01:44.440 --> 01:46.040
- What's this?
- A brand.

01:47.080 --> 01:48.560
Same as the one behind Hanxiao's ear.

01:51.560 --> 01:53.760
DU'S MANSION

01:54.440 --> 01:56.520
Old man, find anything yet?

01:56.600 --> 01:57.720
What poison is it, exactly?

02:00.080 --> 02:02.320
This is my homemade wine.

02:02.400 --> 02:03.880
Xiao,

02:04.520 --> 02:06.600
you'll appreciate its delicate nature.

02:07.320 --> 02:10.400
I named this wine Amber Glow.

02:10.479 --> 02:12.720
Look. That color.

02:12.800 --> 02:14.840
Now smell it. That aroma.

02:15.440 --> 02:16.280
Fine craftsmanship, Mr. Du.

02:18.200 --> 02:21.720
I bought the best grapes
from Persian merchants.

02:22.320 --> 02:23.880
Only made this one small barrel.

02:23.960 --> 02:26.000
Come on. First cup from the new jar.

02:26.080 --> 02:27.320
It's for you to taste.

02:27.400 --> 02:29.080
- You're not talking, huh?
- Please.

02:31.680 --> 02:32.720
Put the barrel down.

02:32.800 --> 02:34.800
- This wine is precious!
- Talk or not?

02:35.720 --> 02:36.560
Put it down and I'll talk.

02:36.640 --> 02:37.880
- Three…
- I'll talk!

02:37.960 --> 02:39.560
Okay… I'll talk.

02:39.640 --> 02:41.040
Bird-poison. Aconite.

02:41.120 --> 02:42.840
Killer's got a lot of hate,

02:42.920 --> 02:44.280
but not much experience.

02:44.360 --> 02:47.720
They threw in the most lethal stuff
they could think of.

02:49.640 --> 02:51.480
There's one more plant.

02:52.080 --> 02:53.440
But what exactly it is,

02:54.080 --> 02:54.920
I couldn't tell.

02:55.000 --> 02:56.320
When can you tell?

02:56.400 --> 02:57.640
I can't.

02:57.720 --> 02:59.560
Herbs are like snake venom.

02:59.640 --> 03:00.480
There are thousands.

03:00.560 --> 03:02.880
Unless the poisoner admits it themselves,

03:02.960 --> 03:05.720
- otherwise, it's hard to tell.
- Really?

03:06.680 --> 03:09.040
Really. I already told you.

03:09.120 --> 03:10.960
Now give me the wine.

03:11.680 --> 03:12.880
What an old man.

03:12.960 --> 03:13.960
You get more long-winded with age.

03:14.040 --> 03:15.600
Bet you're bored at home.

03:16.400 --> 03:17.840
Bored?

03:17.920 --> 03:19.800
I've retired.

03:19.880 --> 03:23.920
The one thing I should do is… rest.

03:24.640 --> 03:27.160
Come on. Let's drink.

03:28.240 --> 03:30.720
Someone's been poisoned
and might not be dead yet.

03:30.800 --> 03:32.440
We can't save them.

03:32.520 --> 03:33.720
This poison's vicious.

03:33.800 --> 03:34.800
Even if an immortal shows up,

03:34.880 --> 03:36.880
there's still no way. Come on.

03:40.320 --> 03:41.360
Just as I thought.

03:41.440 --> 03:42.840
Even the Imperial Medical Office said

03:42.920 --> 03:45.440
there's no saving them.

03:45.520 --> 03:46.520
Yeah.

03:46.600 --> 03:47.640
The medical officers checked.

03:47.720 --> 03:48.600
All said they won't make it.

03:48.680 --> 03:50.160
What do they know?

03:50.240 --> 03:51.880
Treating illness, sure.

03:51.960 --> 03:53.720
Detox? That's my job.

03:54.560 --> 03:58.000
That person's life
can still be held on a bit.

03:58.080 --> 04:00.360
As long as, before they die,

04:00.440 --> 04:03.040
we find the last poison,

04:03.120 --> 04:05.840
get the antidote, and add my prescription.

04:08.680 --> 04:10.720
Old man, that's you alright!

04:10.800 --> 04:12.280
Inspector Du,
you're well-read and worldly.

04:13.960 --> 04:15.560
This is nothing yet.

04:15.640 --> 04:16.800
Just wait.

04:16.880 --> 04:19.000
I'll get you two something good!

04:27.880 --> 04:30.320
The artist drew these sketches
based on their bone structures.

04:30.400 --> 04:31.960
Their bodies were badly swollen.

04:32.040 --> 04:33.240
So it's only an approximation.

04:33.320 --> 04:34.720
Except for Birou,

04:35.240 --> 04:36.440
the other six girls are all here.

04:36.520 --> 04:39.240
These days, Mr. Gu
has visited their hometowns.

04:39.320 --> 04:40.800
No one's seen them return.

04:41.440 --> 04:42.920
Besides these six girls,

04:43.440 --> 04:44.480
those who got killed

04:44.560 --> 04:46.600
were mostly former clients
of Xiuhong House.

04:47.200 --> 04:49.080
Why would the killer
want to wipe them all out?

04:50.400 --> 04:51.520
Mr. Xiao,

04:51.600 --> 04:53.640
you said you'd seen Birou before. Where?

05:00.880 --> 05:02.320
How long have you been back here?

05:03.920 --> 05:04.840
I just got back.

05:05.440 --> 05:06.600
Or did you never leave at all?

05:09.240 --> 05:11.960
Your Ladyship,
I didn't mean to hide it from you.

05:12.600 --> 05:13.760
I'm sick like this.

05:13.840 --> 05:16.600
Even if I went back home,
I couldn't make a living.

05:17.120 --> 05:19.480
So… I stayed here instead.

05:30.080 --> 05:31.600
What do you do for a living?

05:35.520 --> 05:36.920
Smells so good.

05:37.000 --> 05:39.520
I blend essential oils and hair oil.

05:39.600 --> 05:42.200
They nourish the hair
and help condition the body too.

05:42.800 --> 05:45.240
If Your Ladyship likes it,
take a few jars back with you.

05:45.840 --> 05:47.440
If you don't like it too strong,

05:47.520 --> 05:49.400
I can make a lighter scent as well.

05:51.480 --> 05:52.480
Stop picking at it.

05:52.560 --> 05:53.400
You're making it bleed.

05:55.080 --> 05:56.400
I'll be fine with some honey balm.

05:56.480 --> 05:58.520
Are you still in touch
with Ruyi and the others?

06:00.200 --> 06:02.400
I wasn't that close with them.

06:02.480 --> 06:04.760
And I didn't leave
Western Capital with them.

06:07.600 --> 06:08.880
Did something happen to them?

06:10.280 --> 06:12.640
If you hear anything about them,
please tell me.

06:16.280 --> 06:17.520
ZHUQUE GATE

06:17.600 --> 06:18.680
Wuren.

06:23.160 --> 06:24.000
Mr. Gu.

06:24.600 --> 06:26.600
Are you looking for an official
who's been on leave?

06:27.200 --> 06:28.200
You have a lead on him?

06:28.800 --> 06:30.120
I know someone.

06:30.200 --> 06:32.520
The day after Prince of Heng died,
he suddenly took leave

06:32.600 --> 06:34.040
and said he had to rush home.

06:34.120 --> 06:35.240
But these past few days,

06:35.320 --> 06:37.640
he summoned
all the famous physicians to his house.

06:38.440 --> 06:41.280
Though… Maybe I'm overthinking it.

06:42.120 --> 06:43.360
Who is it?

06:45.320 --> 06:48.320
Chief Justice, Wu Yuekun.

06:49.200 --> 06:54.160
WU'S MANSION

06:55.840 --> 06:57.720
Sirs, my master has gone out.

06:57.800 --> 06:59.200
Waiting here is pointless.

07:01.200 --> 07:02.560
Tell your lady

07:03.080 --> 07:05.880
your master's poison
can only be cured by me.

07:22.400 --> 07:23.640
What medicines have you used?

07:30.080 --> 07:32.560
We found the best physicians
in Western Capital.

07:32.640 --> 07:33.960
They prescribed antidotes.

07:34.560 --> 07:36.440
But they said the poison is strange.
It can't be fully neutralized.

07:36.520 --> 07:38.400
It's only barely keeping him alive.

07:38.480 --> 07:41.880
We don't even know
how long he can hold on.

07:47.320 --> 07:48.480
Your Ladyship,

07:49.440 --> 07:51.960
can my husband still be saved?

07:52.600 --> 07:54.680
Catch the killer sooner,

07:54.760 --> 07:56.440
and we save him sooner.

07:57.080 --> 07:58.440
It depends on whether you cooperate.

08:00.600 --> 08:02.160
I'm just a woman.

08:02.240 --> 08:03.520
How am I supposed to catch a killer?

08:04.280 --> 08:05.800
Just answer our questions.

08:05.880 --> 08:07.040
Five days ago,

08:07.120 --> 08:09.600
did Wu Yuekun go
to Vice Minister Yang's home?

08:09.680 --> 08:10.960
Was he poisoned the same night?

08:16.760 --> 08:18.360
Do you have anyone else to rely on?

08:22.120 --> 08:23.720
If Wu Yuekun truly dies,

08:24.520 --> 08:26.040
how will you live from then on?

08:34.600 --> 08:36.480
Why should I believe

08:36.559 --> 08:38.240
you can save my husband?

08:40.080 --> 08:42.360
You're desperate and grasping at straws.

08:42.440 --> 08:45.080
If not us, who else can you trust?

08:54.000 --> 08:55.400
If I say the wrong thing,

08:56.440 --> 08:58.560
he'll beat me to death!

09:04.040 --> 09:07.080
Fine. When he dies,
no one will hit you again.

09:09.480 --> 09:10.520
I'll talk.

09:10.600 --> 09:11.920
I'll talk.

09:15.160 --> 09:16.280
Five days ago,

09:16.360 --> 09:18.400
my husband went out to entertain guests.

09:18.480 --> 09:20.320
He came back early, all of a sudden.

09:20.920 --> 09:22.880
Then he kept coughing blood.

09:23.840 --> 09:25.080
He warned me

09:25.160 --> 09:26.920
not to let anyone know.

09:27.520 --> 09:29.640
Then he passed out.

09:30.560 --> 09:32.080
Our driver was afraid

09:32.160 --> 09:33.960
he'd be dragged into a murder case.

09:34.040 --> 09:38.880
He told me my husband
had gone to Vice Minister Yang's house.

09:38.960 --> 09:41.880
After that, he resigned
and wouldn't stay a single extra day.

09:42.960 --> 09:44.840
He must've stepped in something big.

09:45.760 --> 09:46.600
But…

09:47.920 --> 09:50.040
I'm just a woman.

09:50.120 --> 09:51.920
What could I do?

09:53.160 --> 09:55.400
That's all I know. Your Ladyship…

09:57.760 --> 09:58.600
Your Ladyship!

09:59.200 --> 10:01.040
Please save my husband!

10:38.920 --> 10:40.880
Go tell the physicians you hired

10:40.960 --> 10:42.200
there's no Gelsemium in this poison.

10:42.800 --> 10:45.960
It's aconite. Your prescription is off.

10:46.040 --> 10:47.440
He'd be better off
just drinking warm water.

10:47.520 --> 10:48.560
Alright.

10:49.600 --> 10:50.680
I'll go now.

11:00.720 --> 11:01.640
Stop staring.

11:02.320 --> 11:04.120
You should thank your lady.

11:04.200 --> 11:05.160
She just saved your life.

11:05.800 --> 11:07.680
That pill I gave you just now

11:07.760 --> 11:09.720
will buy you four hours at most.

11:10.440 --> 11:12.560
Tell the truth
and help us catch the killer fast,

11:12.640 --> 11:15.080
or keep stalling and die for it.

11:15.160 --> 11:16.040
You choose.

11:17.480 --> 11:19.960
The real owner of Xiuhong House
is you, isn't it?

11:22.240 --> 11:24.760
You pretended to let Prosecutor Cheng
investigate closely,

11:24.840 --> 11:26.760
so you could track every step of the case

11:26.840 --> 11:28.120
and line up scapegoats in advance.

11:28.200 --> 11:29.520
You played it safe at every turn.

11:29.600 --> 11:31.120
You finally got away clean.

11:31.200 --> 11:32.680
So why risk it now?

11:34.440 --> 11:37.800
Are you that stupid,
or do you think we are?

11:45.160 --> 11:47.680
Xiao Huaijin…

11:49.480 --> 11:51.560
You're so young,

11:51.640 --> 11:54.480
yet just like your father,
always lecturing.

11:55.360 --> 11:57.840
Say whatever you want.

11:57.920 --> 11:59.960
Spin it however you like.

12:01.360 --> 12:05.360
I was only poisoned by accident

12:05.440 --> 12:08.360
in my own house.

12:08.440 --> 12:10.120
As for the rest,

12:10.880 --> 12:12.480
I know nothing.

12:18.000 --> 12:19.760
You schemed it this long,

12:20.480 --> 12:22.240
and all you've got is deny?

12:22.920 --> 12:24.920
Just like Lu Zhenglian.

12:25.560 --> 12:28.400
So you deny going
to Vice Minister Yang's house

12:28.480 --> 12:30.600
and having anything
to do with those girls?

12:31.800 --> 12:34.560
I've kept my name clean my whole life.

12:34.640 --> 12:37.080
Don't you slander me!

12:45.240 --> 12:46.080
Fine.

12:47.440 --> 12:49.520
Since you want to play the good official,

12:50.440 --> 12:51.920
I'll tell you a story.

12:52.600 --> 12:53.680
Deputy Director Xiao,

12:54.240 --> 12:56.680
what story could possibly
suit the Chief Justice?

12:59.960 --> 13:01.360
Of course,

13:01.440 --> 13:04.000
the story of hating evil
and upholding justice

13:04.080 --> 13:05.800
at all cost.

13:07.080 --> 13:08.120
Go on, please.

13:08.800 --> 13:09.840
In the Xiuhong House case,

13:09.920 --> 13:12.360
though Sun Zhiwang
and Lu Zhenglian have met justice,

13:12.440 --> 13:13.600
everyone knows

13:13.680 --> 13:16.000
the real masterminds,
those nobles who abused palace maids,

13:16.600 --> 13:18.120
are still at large.

13:18.800 --> 13:20.360
Chief Justice Wu Yuekun

13:20.440 --> 13:22.000
was heartsick to see the law trampled,

13:22.080 --> 13:24.640
his men set up, and even more heartsick

13:24.720 --> 13:25.920
that justice couldn't be served.

13:26.680 --> 13:27.640
But he also knew

13:27.720 --> 13:29.160
all witnesses and evidence were gone.

13:29.240 --> 13:33.000
By normal means,
he could never get true justice.

13:33.080 --> 13:34.200
So,

13:34.840 --> 13:36.400
he chose the dangerous path

13:37.000 --> 13:40.520
to make them pay in his own way.

13:41.720 --> 13:43.440
But how would he make them pay?

13:43.520 --> 13:45.760
After hearing Lou Chuo's confession,

13:45.840 --> 13:48.200
he tracked down Prince of Heng,
the one with scars on his inner wrist.

13:48.280 --> 13:50.080
He pretended to win Prince of Heng's trust

13:50.160 --> 13:52.200
and little by little,
dug up that whole group's secrets.

13:52.280 --> 13:53.280
Five days ago,

13:53.880 --> 13:56.000
he and Prince of Heng met in secret
at Vice Minister Yang's home.

13:56.080 --> 13:58.000
He used the chance
to scatter homemade poison

13:58.080 --> 13:59.440
into the pond.

14:01.240 --> 14:02.800
To avoid suspicion,

14:03.320 --> 14:05.120
he'd rather enter
the poisoned pond himself

14:05.200 --> 14:06.840
and go down with them.

14:06.920 --> 14:08.760
Thankfully, Heaven was watching.

14:08.840 --> 14:12.040
He took the antidote in time
and kept his life.

14:17.240 --> 14:19.120
What a heroic and epic story,

14:19.200 --> 14:20.560
a touching one.

14:21.080 --> 14:22.960
His Majesty will surely show mercy

14:23.040 --> 14:25.200
and praise your noble heart,

14:25.280 --> 14:27.200
even if

14:27.280 --> 14:30.800
- you poisoned His Majesty's own son.
- You…

14:30.880 --> 14:33.800
You think I've got no proof,
just making things up?

14:33.880 --> 14:35.080
You…

14:35.160 --> 14:37.040
Of course I have proof.

14:48.520 --> 14:50.240
Your personal token,

14:50.920 --> 14:52.200
an imperial gift.

14:53.000 --> 14:54.520
What are you doing?

14:54.600 --> 14:57.160
What are you doing?

15:00.400 --> 15:02.000
Looking for evidence, of course.

15:03.080 --> 15:06.200
After I drained the poison water
from Vice Minister Yang's pond,

15:06.280 --> 15:08.240
I found this at the bottom.

15:14.080 --> 15:17.000
This bottle of poison
was mixed just for you.

15:17.080 --> 15:19.160
It's almost like what was in the pond.

15:19.240 --> 15:22.520
Once it's diluted in water,
it's a perfect match.

15:23.240 --> 15:26.120
Little vials like this,
I hid five or six in your residence.

15:27.680 --> 15:28.720
Don't rush.

15:28.800 --> 15:30.520
When the Palace Investigation Bureau
searches your home,

15:31.120 --> 15:32.280
you'll see where I hid them.

15:35.320 --> 15:36.680
What we lack now is a witness.

15:37.400 --> 15:39.120
Your lady won't admit it, of course.

15:39.760 --> 15:41.360
And your driver has long fled.

15:41.440 --> 15:42.720
But that's fine.

15:43.360 --> 15:44.560
The gatekeeper
at Vice Minister Yang's house

15:44.640 --> 15:45.480
saw you that night.

15:45.560 --> 15:46.520
He can testify.

15:46.600 --> 15:49.520
He's lying. He's lying!

15:49.600 --> 15:51.000
Yeah, he is lying.

15:51.080 --> 15:54.520
But this remains a secret
known only to us.

15:59.240 --> 16:01.400
You're best at erasing evidence.

16:01.480 --> 16:04.200
Then let me show you
the art of fabricating it.

16:04.720 --> 16:07.560
You can lie through your teeth,
and I can twist the truth too.

16:08.160 --> 16:09.840
Thanks to you, you "elders,"

16:09.920 --> 16:12.320
I've learned quite a few
new ways to crack a case.

16:12.840 --> 16:14.360
Since you like to play,

16:14.960 --> 16:16.120
I'll play to the end.

16:17.120 --> 16:20.400
I'd rather die than let you have your way!

16:27.640 --> 16:29.560
You'd better keep your word.

16:29.640 --> 16:31.600
But don't think dying ends this.

16:31.680 --> 16:33.120
If you dare kill yourself,

16:33.200 --> 16:35.280
I'll make this story stick anyway

16:35.360 --> 16:36.640
and wipe out your whole clan,

16:36.720 --> 16:38.600
no heirs left.

16:42.440 --> 16:45.640
I have no parents. A cursed lone star.

16:45.720 --> 16:47.200
I don't fear living,
and I sure don't fear dying.

17:01.560 --> 17:03.000
But Wu Yuekun…

17:04.200 --> 17:05.200
do you fear?

17:20.920 --> 17:23.240
It's all those girls' fault!

17:23.920 --> 17:26.520
I was ready to quit for good.

17:27.560 --> 17:30.000
But they came begging me,

17:30.840 --> 17:32.960
saying once they left Xiuhong House,

17:33.040 --> 17:34.760
they had no way to live.

17:34.840 --> 17:36.760
They asked me to help them.

17:37.760 --> 17:41.320
They even hatched the plan themselves.

17:42.400 --> 17:45.760
To go to the ministers' mansions.

17:45.840 --> 17:48.280
Safer and more fun that way.

17:48.360 --> 17:50.560
I went soft

17:50.640 --> 17:52.600
and agreed.

17:53.880 --> 17:55.800
They got me killed.

17:55.880 --> 17:58.160
They got me killed!

18:00.600 --> 18:02.360
You're beyond saving.

18:04.160 --> 18:05.440
If you want to save
your wife and children,

18:06.160 --> 18:09.080
write your crimes down, every last one.

18:09.160 --> 18:10.600
In two hours,

18:11.240 --> 18:13.840
whether you walk back to the living
or walk towards the underworld

18:13.920 --> 18:14.760
is up to you.

18:40.880 --> 18:43.480
This is where Wu Yuekun kept those girls.

18:44.160 --> 18:45.640
This room's too neat.

18:45.720 --> 18:46.920
Doesn't look like anyone lived here.

18:49.000 --> 18:51.280
Would women use the exact same balm?

18:51.360 --> 18:52.880
Especially women living together.

18:52.960 --> 18:54.160
Usually not.

18:54.760 --> 18:56.520
Especially those who live by their looks.

18:56.600 --> 18:59.720
They need something
clients will remember at once.

19:05.320 --> 19:07.720
Sun, moon, and stars are alike in form,
jewel-like in glow.

19:07.800 --> 19:08.800
Sustained by essence,

19:08.880 --> 19:11.000
each keeps its role
and shines its radiance.

19:11.080 --> 19:12.400
Though stars are all spheres,

19:12.480 --> 19:13.920
their sizes, colors,

19:14.000 --> 19:15.640
and speeds all differ.

19:15.720 --> 19:16.920
People are no different,

19:17.000 --> 19:18.960
each with their own tastes and habits.

19:19.040 --> 19:22.080
And those habits leave traces

19:22.160 --> 19:24.560
in what they use and where they live.

19:28.320 --> 19:31.800
But all six arranged
their space identically,

19:32.480 --> 19:34.280
even using the same items.

19:34.360 --> 19:37.680
And there's nothing here
that matches who they were.

19:38.760 --> 19:40.160
In this room,

19:40.240 --> 19:43.280
I can't read any clues, any preferences.

19:43.880 --> 19:46.000
Women should at least have
some personal items.

19:46.520 --> 19:47.360
A handkerchief,

19:47.440 --> 19:48.720
a sachet,

19:48.800 --> 19:50.720
or jewelry with their name on it.

19:51.680 --> 19:52.920
None here.

19:53.000 --> 19:54.720
Not on their bodies either.

19:55.840 --> 19:56.880
Two possibilities.

19:57.400 --> 19:59.760
First, someone cleaned this place.

20:00.280 --> 20:01.120
Second,

20:02.360 --> 20:03.520
they knew they were going to die.

20:33.400 --> 20:34.680
Where is Vice Minister Yang's body?

20:34.760 --> 20:35.760
Over there.

20:54.600 --> 20:56.680
So that's how the poison was brought in.

21:15.920 --> 21:19.320
DISCIPLINE AND PRUDENCE

21:19.400 --> 21:20.240
Come on.

21:21.560 --> 21:23.680
- Have a sip.
- Much obliged.

21:28.680 --> 21:31.080
- Well?
- That's fine wine.

21:33.920 --> 21:35.400
Xiao,

21:35.480 --> 21:37.080
come by often.

21:37.160 --> 21:39.520
If you get my wine, you get me.

21:41.720 --> 21:45.120
That wild girl…
She finally let you rest today?

21:45.720 --> 21:47.680
She was going
to the Court of Judicial Review,

21:47.760 --> 21:48.600
so she told me to wait here.

21:51.080 --> 21:53.080
She… She's coming here again?

21:54.160 --> 21:55.600
Old man!

21:55.680 --> 21:56.880
Save me!

22:02.040 --> 22:03.040
What happened?

22:03.120 --> 22:05.400
How is it? Same as the poison
Prince of Heng took?

22:07.520 --> 22:08.600
Same.

22:11.640 --> 22:13.880
You poisoned yourself on purpose
just to trick me into tasting it?

22:14.600 --> 22:16.440
Just a sip. It won't kill you.

22:17.320 --> 22:20.000
Besides, with your miracle antidote,

22:20.080 --> 22:21.160
we're safe.

22:27.680 --> 22:29.160
You found how they poisoned them?

22:30.400 --> 22:31.240
I did.

22:31.920 --> 22:32.960
But we still need one person.

22:33.640 --> 22:35.080
The one who supplied them the poison.

22:37.840 --> 22:38.880
Did anyone go in?

22:38.960 --> 22:40.800
No. Only one servant
delivered the medicine,

22:40.880 --> 22:42.200
and I carried it in.

22:51.720 --> 22:52.640
No way.

22:53.240 --> 22:55.440
That servant
took a sip right in front of me.

23:10.800 --> 23:14.600
Beeswax. Clove. Sweet reseda.

23:17.800 --> 23:19.000
That person never planned to live.

23:20.680 --> 23:21.680
That person…

23:22.280 --> 23:23.800
You will have to see them yourself.

23:41.640 --> 23:43.600
Have I caused you trouble again?

23:45.920 --> 23:47.080
For people like that,

23:47.920 --> 23:50.480
to throw away your life, is it worth it?

23:53.280 --> 23:55.400
For people like us,

23:55.480 --> 23:58.360
dying is easier than living.

23:59.360 --> 24:00.640
If we die

24:00.720 --> 24:03.160
and drag those beasts down with us,

24:04.920 --> 24:06.120
then it's not a bad trade.

24:09.360 --> 24:10.240
Your Ladyship, please sit.

24:20.920 --> 24:22.680
That day, after Mr. Xiao

24:22.760 --> 24:24.720
sent us away from Western Capital,

24:25.720 --> 24:27.880
I fought with Ruyi in the carriage.

24:28.600 --> 24:31.000
Back then, if she hadn't
gone back on her word,

24:31.080 --> 24:33.120
she clearly remembered that client's face,

24:33.200 --> 24:34.560
then suddenly changed her story,

24:35.360 --> 24:37.920
you would've caught all those monsters.

24:39.080 --> 24:40.880
You wouldn't have
been framed and jailed either.

24:41.480 --> 24:43.480
You did so much for us,

24:43.560 --> 24:44.920
and it all went to waste.

24:46.000 --> 24:47.000
Hanxiao,

24:48.120 --> 24:48.960
Taozhi.

24:50.160 --> 24:51.440
They died for nothing too.

24:53.840 --> 24:56.840
I was furious.
I didn't want to travel with them,

24:56.920 --> 24:58.320
so I got off the carriage.

25:03.600 --> 25:06.080
That day, I didn't have a single coin.

25:09.520 --> 25:10.760
To get my purse back,

25:11.920 --> 25:13.520
I ran after the carriage.

25:15.000 --> 25:16.160
But I never thought

25:17.200 --> 25:18.640
I'd actually catch up.

25:21.240 --> 25:22.440
What happened?

25:24.240 --> 25:26.120
Ruyi? Cuizhu?

25:27.640 --> 25:28.640
Where are you?

25:32.200 --> 25:33.160
Sir,

25:33.680 --> 25:35.520
what happened? Where are they?

25:37.440 --> 25:38.680
Wu Yue…

25:38.760 --> 25:39.960
Say it.

25:40.040 --> 25:40.880
…Kun!

25:43.560 --> 25:45.240
With every last ounce of strength,

25:46.440 --> 25:48.360
that man said one name.

25:51.400 --> 25:52.240
Wu Yuekun.

25:53.320 --> 25:54.440
I don't know if Ruyi and the others

25:55.040 --> 25:56.520
are dead or alive.

25:58.800 --> 26:00.880
Not until I reached
the Court of Judicial Review gate

26:00.960 --> 26:02.280
did I see his face.

26:02.880 --> 26:04.440
Even without a mask,

26:04.520 --> 26:05.880
I'd still recognize him.

26:05.960 --> 26:08.240
He's the real owner of Xiuhong House.

26:08.320 --> 26:09.960
I saw him there.

26:10.760 --> 26:13.120
Before the banquet began that day,

26:13.200 --> 26:15.240
Zhenniang had us change clothes.

26:16.240 --> 26:17.920
Then, like we were merchandise,

26:18.720 --> 26:20.440
she presented us to him.

26:21.040 --> 26:24.120
His eyes were like a hawk's.

26:25.360 --> 26:26.800
Even through the mask,

26:27.560 --> 26:28.880
he sized us up.

26:31.160 --> 26:33.280
And with his own hands,

26:34.040 --> 26:35.680
he pushed us into an endless nightmare.

26:40.240 --> 26:42.520
Yet he didn't even remember who I was.

26:43.560 --> 26:46.680
He even asked what grievance I had.

26:48.560 --> 26:50.880
That's when I finally understood

26:50.960 --> 26:52.960
why Ruyi kept changing her words.

26:54.040 --> 26:56.520
And I understood why you and Mr. Xiao

26:57.400 --> 26:59.880
couldn't save her,
no matter how hard you tried.

27:01.880 --> 27:05.080
Because the one investigating the case
was the mastermind.

27:06.360 --> 27:07.760
So you decided to take revenge.

27:09.920 --> 27:12.000
But at the time, I didn't know how.

27:14.920 --> 27:17.080
I feared Ruyi and the others
were already dead,

27:18.640 --> 27:20.440
but I prayed they were still alive.

27:22.000 --> 27:23.320
So…

27:24.680 --> 27:27.320
every day, I followed Wu Yuekun.

27:27.400 --> 27:28.960
I wanted to find them,

27:30.360 --> 27:31.840
but he was cautious.

27:32.400 --> 27:34.480
That house gate was always guarded.

27:35.120 --> 27:37.920
Later, I don't know what Ruyi did,

27:38.000 --> 27:39.600
but she earned Wu Yuekun's trust.

27:41.640 --> 27:44.200
He even let her go out

27:44.280 --> 27:45.960
to buy makeup and powder.

27:47.800 --> 27:50.240
I seized the chance to meet her.

27:58.920 --> 28:00.080
Why are you here?

28:00.160 --> 28:01.720
Why are you here too?

28:04.680 --> 28:06.600
Western Capital isn't a place for you.

28:07.320 --> 28:09.160
- Leave, now.
- Come with me.

28:11.960 --> 28:13.440
I know a back road.

28:13.520 --> 28:14.440
Within two hours,

28:14.520 --> 28:16.760
I can get you on a southbound boat.

28:16.840 --> 28:17.960
As for the other girls,

28:18.040 --> 28:19.360
I'll find a way to save them.

28:19.880 --> 28:21.400
I won't let him drag you back again.

28:23.680 --> 28:25.120
He didn't take them.

28:26.320 --> 28:27.640
I brought them back.

28:29.000 --> 28:31.840
- You…
- Since he won't let us go,

28:32.480 --> 28:33.600
then…

28:34.200 --> 28:35.560
I won't let him go either.

28:38.800 --> 28:40.040
With this token,

28:40.640 --> 28:42.000
at the next relay station,

28:42.080 --> 28:45.760
they'll send men
to escort you the rest of the way.

28:52.040 --> 28:53.720
I'm going to kill Wu Yuekun

28:54.840 --> 28:56.360
and avenge everyone.

28:57.800 --> 28:59.160
We'll kill him together.

29:01.360 --> 29:02.760
Do you really want to kill him?

29:03.520 --> 29:05.120
Not just him.

29:06.920 --> 29:08.680
I want to kill myself too.

29:11.720 --> 29:13.640
I thought leaving Xiuhong House

29:15.040 --> 29:16.440
would end the nightmare.

29:16.520 --> 29:19.320
But… ever since that day,

29:21.400 --> 29:24.000
not one night have I slept in peace.

29:24.840 --> 29:26.640
The moment I think

29:26.720 --> 29:28.480
of those men with their blades,

29:28.560 --> 29:29.880
cutting into us

29:29.960 --> 29:31.920
one slice after another,

29:32.520 --> 29:35.240
still able to live at ease,
safe and sound,

29:36.280 --> 29:39.040
I… I don't even dare to die.

29:39.640 --> 29:41.120
I'm so scared.

29:42.400 --> 29:44.040
I'm scared that if I die,

29:44.120 --> 29:47.480
no one will ever know what they did.

29:51.560 --> 29:52.840
Ruyi told me

29:53.360 --> 29:55.320
that to stay alive,

29:56.000 --> 29:57.480
they pretended

29:57.560 --> 30:00.560
they wanted to stick with Wu Yuekun
and make a living.

30:01.160 --> 30:03.840
They even came up with a plan
he couldn't refuse.

30:04.520 --> 30:07.440
They'd build him a "moving" Xiuhong House.

30:08.600 --> 30:10.160
Wu Yuekun was wary and suspicious.

30:11.000 --> 30:14.120
No matter how perfect the plan was,
he wouldn't agree easily.

30:16.640 --> 30:18.840
To win Wu Yuekun's trust,

30:19.440 --> 30:20.840
Ruyi did a lot of talking.

30:22.320 --> 30:23.720
She even told him,

30:25.080 --> 30:27.640
if not for Hanxiao and Taozhi

30:27.720 --> 30:29.200
making such a big fuss,

30:29.840 --> 30:31.720
she never would've wanted
to leave Xiuhong House.

30:33.840 --> 30:35.320
Ruyi also discovered

30:36.120 --> 30:37.600
that though Wu Yuekun was cautious,

30:38.200 --> 30:41.440
his superiors seemed to be pressuring him
to reopen Xiuhong House.

30:41.520 --> 30:43.800
So she played to his tastes

30:44.560 --> 30:46.480
and proposed a traveling pleasure den.

30:48.160 --> 30:51.040
Only then did Wu Yuekun say
he'd keep working with them.

30:51.760 --> 30:54.920
But targeting noble households
wasn't easy.

30:56.680 --> 31:00.320
Every time they entered,
they were searched top to bottom.

31:01.320 --> 31:03.560
And for a long time,
they couldn't find a chance to act.

31:06.320 --> 31:08.000
Until I came up with a way.

32:09.960 --> 32:11.280
You must've

32:11.960 --> 32:13.520
pieced together the rest.

32:16.360 --> 32:18.080
I thought my vengeance was done

32:18.960 --> 32:21.080
and wanted to follow them in death.

32:22.800 --> 32:25.280
But I found Wu Yuekun wasn't dead.

32:29.160 --> 32:30.760
I couldn't understand

32:32.520 --> 32:34.560
why that day, I was the only lucky one

32:34.640 --> 32:37.040
jumping off the carriage and escaping it.

32:37.640 --> 32:38.920
Not until that moment

32:39.680 --> 32:42.680
did I understand Heaven had its plan.

32:44.040 --> 32:47.000
It was so that when that beast Wu Yuekun

32:47.080 --> 32:48.800
was barely clinging to life,

32:49.960 --> 32:52.320
I could hand him one more bowl of poison.

33:05.440 --> 33:06.920
- This place is so beautiful.
- Careful!

33:09.520 --> 33:11.080
- That's so fun!
- Come!

33:11.160 --> 33:12.160
Look!

33:16.440 --> 33:17.360
It's warmed up.

33:19.400 --> 33:22.520
The flowers back home are about to bloom.

33:33.200 --> 33:35.680
Your Ladyship, do you know?

33:36.680 --> 33:38.840
That Hundred Charms flower
on the palace wall

33:39.560 --> 33:41.040
has another name.

33:44.720 --> 33:45.800
It's called Hanxiao.

34:05.120 --> 34:05.960
Madam,

34:06.960 --> 34:08.679
is this where palace maids are buried?

34:09.360 --> 34:10.800
Your elder sister
was a former palace maid.

34:10.880 --> 34:12.040
She shouldn't have been buried here.

34:12.120 --> 34:14.960
But His Majesty showed mercy
and granted her a resting place.

34:20.000 --> 34:22.960
TOMB OF LOU CHUO, TOMB OF HANXIAO

34:23.800 --> 34:25.400
This tomb is huge.

34:26.440 --> 34:27.800
Who's buried inside?

34:28.560 --> 34:30.560
Your sister's close friends in the palace

34:31.480 --> 34:34.840
and the seven bravest women
in all of Western Capital.

34:36.760 --> 34:39.520
TOMB OF THE SEVEN PALACE MAIDS

34:49.679 --> 34:52.159
TOMB OF HANXIAO

34:52.239 --> 34:53.360
Hanxiao…

34:57.000 --> 34:57.840
I folded these

34:58.400 --> 35:00.040
for you myself.

35:01.520 --> 35:03.000
Down there,

35:05.320 --> 35:06.680
use them freely.

35:18.200 --> 35:19.200
His Majesty has issued an edict

35:19.280 --> 35:21.400
to reform the palace maids' discharge.

35:21.480 --> 35:24.720
Maids who leave the palace
will be settled more properly.

35:25.320 --> 35:28.480
The families of the slain maids
will receive compensation.

35:29.160 --> 35:31.440
Prince of Heng's title has been stripped.

35:31.520 --> 35:32.920
As for Wu Yuekun, Vice Minister Yang…

35:33.000 --> 35:36.560
Their families have all been exiled.
Mr. Gu has been reinstated.

35:37.920 --> 35:39.800
All of this cost nine lives.

35:41.120 --> 35:42.520
I solved the case,

35:43.720 --> 35:45.360
but I didn't save anything.

35:51.280 --> 35:55.480
TO THE LATE SISTER GU TAOZHI

36:24.320 --> 36:25.600
It's all over.

36:26.240 --> 36:29.440
My sister will be grateful
to you all from heaven.

36:32.000 --> 36:34.440
Before she passed,
Birou asked me to bring you this.

36:39.720 --> 36:40.880
Birou told me,

36:41.480 --> 36:43.640
that day, Taozhi heard
they were going out to work,

36:44.160 --> 36:45.720
but they couldn't say what job

36:45.800 --> 36:47.040
or where they were going.

36:47.120 --> 36:48.400
She couldn't rest easy.

36:48.480 --> 36:51.320
She didn't even have time to tell you
and got on the carriage with them.

36:52.320 --> 36:54.880
Birou always felt she got Taozhi killed.

36:55.480 --> 36:57.320
She wanted to apologize to you in person,

36:57.400 --> 36:59.160
but she never had the courage.

37:01.720 --> 37:02.840
Taozhi was always like that,

37:03.640 --> 37:05.720
upright, warm-hearted.

37:06.720 --> 37:08.080
That's my sister.

37:10.360 --> 37:12.840
It's only our fault we got there too late.

37:13.560 --> 37:14.880
Don't say that.

37:15.480 --> 37:16.800
If not for you giving it your all,

37:16.880 --> 37:18.960
there might've been more girls harmed.

37:19.880 --> 37:21.200
Even if she'd known the ending,

37:22.120 --> 37:23.040
that day,

37:23.600 --> 37:25.440
she still would've
gotten on that carriage.

37:29.320 --> 37:30.560
I learned from my family's letter

37:30.640 --> 37:32.600
that Mr. Xiao had secured

37:32.680 --> 37:35.520
a fine burial plot
for my sister back home,

37:35.600 --> 37:36.920
so she may rest in peace.

37:39.440 --> 37:40.680
Thank you, Mr. Xiao.

37:42.320 --> 37:44.600
It's all I could do.

37:50.720 --> 37:53.000
That day in prison, I was too rash.

37:56.040 --> 37:56.920
Sorry for my offense.

37:59.640 --> 38:00.720
I…

38:02.320 --> 38:03.480
Take care, Mr. Gu.

38:04.040 --> 38:05.120
We'll be waiting for your return.

38:05.760 --> 38:06.680
Take care.

38:16.600 --> 38:18.840
SWALLOW HOUSE

38:18.920 --> 38:20.520
At the second ke of Shen Hour,

38:20.600 --> 38:23.320
Pang Erlang presents Liu Ying'er
with a winning prize,

38:23.400 --> 38:25.080
Peerless Beauty!

38:25.160 --> 38:28.240
- Bravo!
- Bravo!

38:28.320 --> 38:30.240
You once said

38:30.320 --> 38:32.040
the Astronomical Bureau sends apprentices

38:32.120 --> 38:34.520
to check the water clocks
in the palace and royal mansions.

38:35.120 --> 38:37.280
Would the bureau keep records
of those apprentices?

38:38.680 --> 38:39.800
It would.

38:40.800 --> 38:42.280
Then 15 years ago,

38:42.360 --> 38:45.240
who was sent
to the Prince of Duan's mansion?

38:45.320 --> 38:46.240
Can we find out?

38:48.320 --> 38:50.440
Not sure. It's been so long.

38:50.520 --> 38:51.920
No telling if the record survived.

38:55.280 --> 38:57.640
If we don't know, then it might.

38:58.240 --> 38:59.400
Please help me check.

39:06.560 --> 39:09.800
TWO APPRENTICES
FROM THE PRINCE OF YAN'S MANSION

39:41.480 --> 39:43.200
ZI, CHOU, YIN, MAO, CHEN, SI

39:43.280 --> 39:45.080
CHEN, SI

39:45.160 --> 39:47.600
BY IMPERIAL COMMAND

39:51.400 --> 39:54.440
GENTLE RAINS, PROPITIOUS BREEZES

40:00.360 --> 40:01.240
How is it?

40:03.160 --> 40:04.080
It's been too long.

40:04.160 --> 40:05.240
There's no record left.

40:07.560 --> 40:09.200
Figures. Too much time has passed.

40:10.680 --> 40:11.680
Thank you.

40:21.560 --> 40:23.360
In 15 years,

40:23.440 --> 40:25.800
this is the first time
you asked to see me.

40:26.400 --> 40:28.120
That night at Prince of Duan's mansion,

40:28.200 --> 40:29.960
who was the water-clock apprentice?

40:31.800 --> 40:35.080
Calibrating the clock
is the Astronomical Bureau's duty.

40:35.160 --> 40:36.520
But that page of records was destroyed.

40:37.800 --> 40:40.280
And clearly, someone did it long ago.

40:41.440 --> 40:44.080
She asked you about this?

40:47.160 --> 40:50.040
If there's no trail, then drop it.

40:50.120 --> 40:51.960
That apprentice must know something.

40:55.160 --> 40:56.800
If you don't want her to remember,

40:57.400 --> 40:59.080
why cling to it?

41:03.320 --> 41:04.360
She might forget.

41:06.040 --> 41:07.200
But some things…

41:08.400 --> 41:09.680
I still remember.

41:18.440 --> 41:20.480
HANLIANG HALL

41:40.360 --> 41:43.880
FANGSHENG, PALACE MAID

42:57.440 --> 42:59.920
Ruisheng!
Can't she shut the door properly?

43:05.200 --> 43:06.320
Mother.

43:15.880 --> 43:18.240
Ruisheng even forgot to change the candle.

43:18.920 --> 43:20.720
- Honestly…
- Mother.

43:32.760 --> 43:33.880
Mother.
